# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of obtaining the SK problem from a library as we do for the [Market Split problem](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), you formulate it directly.\n"
msgstr "Bukannya memperoleh masalah SK daripada pustaka seperti yang kita lakukan untuk [masalah Market Split](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), anda merumuskannya secara terus.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `generate_sk_problem` function formulates the SK problem directly in the required dictionary format. The only input required is `n`, the number of spins in the model.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi `generate_sk_problem` merumuskan masalah SK secara terus dalam format kamus yang diperlukan. Satu-satunya input yang diperlukan ialah `n`, iaitu bilangan spin dalam model tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the function `_generate_couplings_sk_model` to calculate the random coupling terms in the SK model. For more control over the couplings, you can use optional arguments, which are explained in the function's docstring.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan fungsi `_generate_couplings_sk_model` untuk mengira sebutan gandingan rawak dalam model SK. Untuk kawalan lebih terhadap gandingan, anda boleh menggunakan argumen pilihan, yang diterangkan dalam docstring fungsi tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Solve the problem using the Parity Twine Optimizer {#step-2-solve-the-problem-using-the-parity-twine-optimizer}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Selesaikan masalah menggunakan Parity Twine Optimizer {#step-2-solve-the-problem-using-the-parity-twine-optimizer}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the functions above, you can set up the SK problem and a find solution by using the Twine Optimizer and a chosen IBM Quantum&reg; backend.\n"
msgstr "Dengan fungsi di atas, anda boleh menyediakan masalah SK dan mencari penyelesaian dengan menggunakan Twine Optimizer dan backend IBM Quantum&reg; pilihan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To run the function, choose a suitable backend; for example, ibm_phoenix.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan fungsi, pilih backend yang sesuai; contohnya, ibm_phoenix.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optionally, use options for additional control over the submission:\n"
msgstr "Secara pilihan, gunakan options untuk kawalan tambahan terhadap penghantaran:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where `shots` is an integer that specifies the number of circuit executions, `postprocessing_level` determines if post-processing is applied to the result,\n"
"`transpile_only` chooses if the problem is only transpiled to a circuit (and not solved), and `job_tags` is label to identify the job on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"dengan `shots` ialah integer yang menentukan bilangan pelaksanaan litar, `postprocessing_level` menentukan sama ada pasca-pemprosesan digunakan pada hasil,\n"
"`transpile_only` memilih sama ada masalah hanya ditranspilasi kepada litar (dan tidak diselesaikan), dan `job_tags` ialah label untuk mengenal pasti job pada IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The size of the SK model is defined by $N$, the number of interacting spins. Once you choose $N$, the code above generates the problem for `n_spins`.\n"
msgstr "Saiz model SK ditakrifkan oleh $N$, bilangan spin yang berinteraksi. Setelah anda memilih $N$, kod di atas menjana masalah untuk `n_spins`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the optimizer:\n"
msgstr "Jalankan pengoptimum:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
