msgstr "Semak status job:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results:\n"
msgstr "Dapatkan hasil:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result is of form:\n"
msgstr "Hasilnya berbentuk:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the `solution` dictionary corresponds to the qubits defined in the problem and gives their optimized spin values for the SK model Hamiltonian.\n"
"This specific sequence of spins in the optimal solution represents the configuration that minimizes the total system energy based on the given random interaction strengths.\n"
"In the SK model, this can be regarded as the lowest energy state of a disordered magnetic system.\n"
msgstr ""
"dengan kamus `solution` sepadan dengan qubit yang ditakrifkan dalam masalah dan memberikan nilai spin yang dioptimumkan bagi Hamiltonian model SK.\n"
"Jujukan spin tertentu ini dalam penyelesaian optimum mewakili konfigurasi yang meminimumkan jumlah tenaga sistem berdasarkan kekuatan interaksi rawak yang diberikan.\n"
"Dalam model SK, ini boleh dianggap sebagai keadaan tenaga terendah bagi sistem magnet yang tidak teratur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`metadata` gives information on the transpilation (two qubit gates counts/depth, gates used, active qubits) and various runtimes.\n"
msgstr "`metadata` memberikan maklumat tentang transpilasi (bilangan/kedalaman gate dua qubit, gate yang digunakan, qubit aktif) dan pelbagai masa jalan.\n"

